  lines:
  - text: 'Here''s something to know: the drops might feel cold, like a tiny raindrop.'
    pose: 0
    narration: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They might sting a little for a few seconds. That's normal, and it goes away fast.
    pose: 0
    narration: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Lots of kids say it's not so bad. You're going to do great!
    pose: 3
    narration: {fileID: 0}
